<p class="x:not-first:mt-6 x:leading-7">Lightpanda v0.2.5 ships a <strong>native Model Context Protocol (MCP) server</strong> built directly into the browser binary. The MCP server shares the same process as the Zig-based JavaScript engine with no CDP intermediary and no extra processes.</p>
